# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ADDED — these were previously untracked-by-accident rather than by
# design, which is how ~90MB of old checkpoint .zip files ended up
# permanently baked into git history across the "Update5/6/7/8" commits.
# None of this belongs in version control: checkpoints and videos are
# large binary training artifacts that change constantly and are already
# managed by the training scripts themselves, not by git.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
checkpoints/
mario_brain_*checkpoint*.zip
videos/
logs/
scratch/
.watchdog_reviewed_*.flag

